---
---

<section class="notice-bento no-print" aria-label="Instrucciones de inscripción">
  <div class="notice-main">
    <div class="notice-icon" aria-hidden="true">ℹ️</div>
    <div class="notice-text">
      <strong>Importante:</strong> Completá una inscripción <strong>UNA VEZ POR CADA MATERIA</strong> a rendir. Tus datos personales quedan recordados localmente para agilizar la carga si rendís más de un examen final.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Heurística H1 + H3: Visibilidad de datos recordados y control de limpieza en PCs compartidas -->
  <div class="draft-status-pill" id="draft-restored-banner" hidden aria-live="polite">
    <span class="draft-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span id="draft-restored-text">Datos recordados en este dispositivo</span>
    <button type="button" class="btn-clear-draft" id="btn-clear-draft">
      Cambiar alumno / Limpiar
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .notice-bento {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .notice-main {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffbeb 0%, var(--brand-accent-light) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
    border-left: 5px solid var(--brand-accent);
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #78350f;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.06);
  }

  .notice-icon {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .draft-status-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: var(--glass-bg);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid var(--bento-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.55rem 0.95rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow);
  }

  .draft-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--feedback-success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.18);
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 0.35rem;
  }

  #draft-restored-text {
    font-weight: 600;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .btn-clear-draft {
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--brand-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--bento-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-clear-draft:hover {
    background: var(--feedback-error-bg);
    color: var(--feedback-error);
    border-color: #fca5a5;
  }
</style>
